 7.72167 41.2723 7.32916C41.0433 6.92575 40.7216 6.68043 40.2801 6.5714C39.7349 6.43511 39.277 6.45692 38.7973 6.64227C38.1812 6.87669 37.7669 7.35097 37.5271 8.08692C37.4017 8.46853 37.3417 8.8992 37.3417 9.38983V15.1799C37.3417 15.3572 37.1979 15.501 37.0206 15.501H34.4409C34.2636 15.501 34.1199 15.3572 34.1199 15.1799V8.78471C34.1199 8.3813 34.0981 7.90702 33.9127 7.4709C33.6565 6.85488 33.1931 6.53324 32.4899 6.48963C31.9611 6.45692 31.514 6.53324 31.1215 6.71859C30.4946 7.01842 30.2002 7.53632 30.0258 8.27227C29.944 8.62662 29.8949 9.00278 29.8949 9.38983Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" />\n          </svg>\n        </span>\n      </a>\n    </header>\n\n<article lang=\"en\">\n  <h1>404 – You’ve lost the trail</h1>\n  <p>\n    Unfortunately, you’ve gone astray (or the page you’re looking for doesn’t\n    exist). Check you’ve typed the correct URL or head back to the home page\n    <a href=\"https://www.komoot.com\">www.komoot.com</a>\n  </p>\n  <p>\n    Feeling really lost? Visit our\n    <a href=\"https://support.komoot.com/hc/en-us\">Help Centre</a>.\n  </p>\n</article>\n\n<article lang=\"de\">\n  <h1>404 – Du bist vom Weg abgekommen</h1>\n  <p>\n    Du scheinst dich verlaufen zu haben (oder die Seite, die du gesucht hast,\n    gibt es nicht). Schau mal nach, ob du die korrekte URL eingegeben hast oder\n    geh zurück zur Homepage auf <a href=\"https://www.komoot.de/\">www.komoot.de</a>.\n  </p>\n  <p>\n    Du fühlst dich richtig verloren? Dann besuch unser\n    <a href=\"https://support.komoot.com/hc/de\">Support-Center</a>.\n  </p>\n</article>\n\n<article lang=\"it\">\n  <h1>404 – Ops, sei fuori traccia</h1>\n  <p>\n    La pagina che stai cercando non esiste. Assicurati di aver digitato l'URL\n    corretta o torna alla home page <a href=\"https://www.komoot.it/\">www.komoot.it</a>\n  </p>\n  <p>\n    Hai davvero perso la traccia? Visita il nostro\n    <a href=\"https://support.komoot.com/hc/it\">Centro assistenza</a>.\n  </p>\n</article>\n\n<article lang=\"nl\">\n  <h1>404 - Verkeerde afslag</h1>\n  <p>\n    Helaas, je bent het pad kwijt (of de pagina die je zoekt bestaat niet).\n    Controleer of je de juiste URL hebt ingetypt, of ga terug naar\n    <a href=\"https://www.komoot.nl/\">www.komoot.nl</a>.\n  </p>\n  <p>\n    Kun je de juiste route echt niet meer terugvinden? Bezoek dan ons\n    <a href=\"https://support.komoot.com/hc/nl\">Helpcentrum</a>.\n  </p>\n</article>\n\n<article lang=\"es\">\n  <h1>GR-404 - Te has salido de la Ruta</h1>\n  <p>\n    Sentimos comunicarte que el destino elegido (o la página que estás buscando)\n    no está en el mapa. Comprueba si la URL es correcta o retrocede hasta\n    <a href=\"https://www.komoot.es/\">www.komoot.es</a>\n  </p>\n  <p>\n    Si no tienes ni idea de por dónde tirar, visita nuestro\n    <a href=\"https://support.komoot.com/hc/es\">Centro de ayuda</a>.\n  </p>\n</article>\n\n<article lang=\"es\">\n  <h1>404 – Oups ! Vous faites fausse route !</h1>\n  <p>\n    Malheureusement, vous vous êtes égaré (ou la page que vous recherchez\n    n'existe pas). Vérifiez que vous avez saisi la bonne adresse URL ou\n    retournez à la page d'accueil <a href=\"https://www.komoot.fr/\">www.komoot.fr</a>\n  </p>\n  <p>\n    Besoin d’aide ? Visitez notre\n    <a href=\"https://support.komoot.com/hc/fr\">Centre d’assistance</a>.\n  </p>\n</article>\n\n  </body>\n</html>\n",
